@* A short count or state, in a rounded capsule: "5 to buy", "3 unread", "4 to review",
   "New · Vol 16", "Coming later". One meaning per tone; colour is never the only
   channel, because the words are always in it. *@

<span class="pill pill--@(Tone.ToString().ToLowerInvariant())">@ChildContent</span>
